<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Hologic Inc.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Hologic Inc.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Montgomery Securities analyst David Crossen said he upgraded Hologic Inc, which makes x-ray systems to measure bone density, to buy from hold.</p>
<p>-- No reason was given for the upgrade.</p>
<p>-- The shares were up 1-1/8 at 23-7/8.</p>
</text>
